text = "The sky above the ruins bleeds red as the sun vanishes behind a black disc. Something unseen speaks from the dark, offering a wager: [color=purple]\"a piece of what you carry, for a die that only shows sixes... or a piece of yourself, if you'd rather keep your trinkets.\"[/color]
[p] [p]The eclipse won't last long enough to think it over twice."
